===Noun===
{{en-noun|es|pl2=weirdos}}

#{{slang}} a strange, odd, eccentric person.
#{{slang}} an insane, possibly dangerous person.
#{{slang}} any person who is behaving in a [[socially]] [[unacceptable]] [[fashion]] or [[manner]], at least as judged by a [[socially]] [[acceptable]] person.
#{{slang}} [[oddly]] [[enough]](!), when [[uttered]] in [[reference]] to [[himself]] or to [[herself]] by a person who considers the designation to be a badge of honor, as a [[compliment]].  Example:  "[[Yeah]], I'm a [[real]] [[weirdo]]."
#{{slang}} [[oddly]] [[enough]] [[also]](!), when [[uttered]] as part of a long [[string]] of [[adjectives]] and/or
[[nouns]], is [[usually]] being [[spoken]] by a person who [[considers]] it to be a very [[positive]] [[thing]] to be [[thought]] of as [[being]] such a person.  Exmaple:  "Yes, I'm [[definitely]] a [[long-haired]]-[[hippy]]-weirdo-[[freak]]!"

